#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:7
msgid "How do I set different prices for different user roles?"
msgstr "Kuidas määrata erinevatele kasutajarollidele erinevaid hindu?"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:8
msgid ""
"Enable the plugin in Settings → General, then use one of two methods: "
"Multipliers (percentage-based adjustments across all products) or Per "
"Product settings (exact prices set directly on each product's edit page for "
"specific roles)."
msgstr ""
"Luba pistikprogramm menüüs „Seaded“ → „Üldine“ ja kasuta seejärel ühte "
"kahest meetodist: „Kordajad“ (protsendipõhised kohandused kõigi toodete "
"puhul) või „Seaded toote kaupa“ (konkreetsetele rollidele määratud täpsed "
"hinnad, mis seatakse otse iga toote redigeerimislehel)."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:11
msgid "What is the difference between Multipliers and Per Product pricing?"
msgstr "Mis vahe on korrutusteguritel ja tootepõhisel hinnakujundusel?"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:12
msgid ""
"Multipliers apply a single multiplier value across all products for a given "
"role. Per Product pricing lets you set exact prices directly on each "
"product's edit page for specific roles, giving you granular per-product "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Korrutajad kohaldavad ühte korrutajat kõikide toodete puhul antud rolli "
"jaoks. Tootepõhine hinnakujundus võimaldab teil määrata täpseid hindu otse "
"iga toote redigeerimislehel konkreetsete rollide jaoks, andes teile "
"granulaarse tootepõhise kontrolli."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:15
msgid "What does 'Make empty price' mean?"
msgstr "Mida tähendab \"Tee tühja hinda\"?"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:16
msgid ""
"When \"Make empty price\" is enabled for a role in Multipliers or Per "
"Product settings, the product price is hidden entirely for that role."
msgstr ""
"Kui rolli jaoks on seadetes „Kordajad“ või „Toote kaupa“ aktiveeritud valik "
"„Näita tühja hinda“, peidetakse selle rolli jaoks toote hind täielikult."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:19
msgid "Why should I disable the plugin for search engine bots?"
msgstr "Miks ma peaksin otsingumootorite robotite jaoks pluginat välja lülitama?"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:20
msgid ""
"Search engines index product prices. If bots see role-specific prices (e.g. "
"a restricted or empty price), it can affect SEO and how products appear in "
"search results. Disabling for bots ensures crawlers always see standard "
"WooCommerce prices."
msgstr ""
"Otsingumootorid indekseerivad toodete hindu. Kui robotid näevad "
"rollispetsiifilisi hindu (nt piiratud või tühja hinda), võib see mõjutada "
"SEO-d ja seda, kuidas tooted otsingutulemustes ilmuvad. Robotite jaoks "
"keelamine tagab, et roomikud näevad alati standardseid WooCommerce'i hindu."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:23
msgid "What happens if I have both Multipliers and Per Product pricing enabled?"
msgstr ""
"Mis juhtub, kui mul on lubatud nii kordajad kui ka tootepõhine "
"hinnakujundus?"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:24
msgid ""
"Per Product prices take precedence over Multipliers by default. If a "
"product has a per-product price set for a role, that price is used. "
"Otherwise, the Multiplier is applied to the standard WooCommerce price."
msgstr ""
"Tootepõhised hinnad on vaikimisi ülimuslikud võrreldes kordajatega. Kui "
"tootele on määratud tootepõhine hind, kasutatakse seda hinda. Vastasel "
"juhul kohaldatakse korrutustegurit WooCommerce'i standardhinnale."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:27
msgid "Can I apply role-based pricing to shipping costs?"
msgstr "Kas ma saan kohaldada rollipõhist hinnakujundust saatmiskuludele?"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/faqs/index.js:28
msgid ""
"Yes. In Settings → Multipliers, enable the \"Apply to Shipping\" option. "
"The same multiplier configured for a role's product prices will also be "
"applied to shipping costs at checkout."
msgstr ""
"Jah. Seadistustes → Korrutajad, lülitage sisse valik \"Kohaldada "
"saatmisele\". Sama korrutust, mis on määratud rolli tootehindadele, "
"kohaldatakse ka saatmiskuludele kassas."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/components/form/SaveBar.js:22
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Muudatuste salvestamine"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/components/form/SaveBar.js:32
msgid "Reset Settings"
msgstr "Seadete lähtestamine"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/components/form/SaveBar.js:38
msgid "Yes, I want to"
msgstr "Jah, ma tahan"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/components/form/SaveBar.js:39
msgid "No, cancel"
msgstr "Ei, tühistage"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/components/form/SaveBar.js:41
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset this section to default settings? This "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Kas olete kindel, et soovite selle jaotise vaikimisi seaded taastada? Seda "
"ei saa tühistada."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/settings/index.js:13
msgid "Messages"
msgstr "Sõnumid"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/settings/index.js:21
msgid "Configure plugin options and preferences"
msgstr "Plugina valikute ja eelistuste konfigureerimine"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/pages/settings/index.js:28
msgid "Read the documentation"
msgstr "Loe dokumentatsiooni"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:14
msgid "Pricing Rules"
msgstr "Hinnakujunduse reeglid"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:15
msgid ""
"Build condition-based rules that automatically apply the right price to the "
"right products, users, and quantities."
msgstr ""
"Looge tingimuspõhised reeglid, mis määravad automaatselt õige hinna "
"õigetele toodetele, kasutajatele ja kogustele."

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:17
msgid "Apply prices per user role, product, or category"
msgstr "Kohalda hindu kasutajarolli, toote või kategooria kaupa"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:18
msgid "Set percentage or fixed-amount price adjustments"
msgstr "Määra protsentuaalsed või kindlasummalised hinnakorrektsioonid"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:19
msgid "Quantity-range discounts (e.g. buy 10+ units, get 20% off)"
msgstr ""
"Kogusest sõltuvad allahindlused (nt osta 10 või enam toodet ja saa 20% "
"allahindlust)"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:20
msgid "Multiple rules with priority ordering"
msgstr "Mitmed reeglid prioriteetsuse järjekorras"

#: build/admin.js:1 dist/price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce/build/admin.js:1
#: src/admin/routes.js:21
msgid "Combine role-based and category-based conditions"
msgstr "Kombineeri rollipõhised ja kategooriatel põhinevad tingimused"

